8.Give the new Layout a name. If the layout is similar to another yo have set up, you can check the box to Copy Layout. 

9.Next you will need to map up the data fields. To do this, drag the PHDWin fields on the left to the matching columns in your spreadsheet.  

·The first column should always be "Primary Import ID Code".  

·The sample image below shows how you would map up the water production token to the correct Source Field in your .csv file. 

·If you map up something incorrectly, you can click on the buttons to Clear Table to remove all fields, or Clear Item to remove the selected line. 

