10.By default, PHDWin will only add new data that is not yet filled out in the program. For example, if you are importing monthly data, only new months of data will be imported. However, if you'd like to update existing data and replace it with what is in your spreadsheet, you can check the box to Replace the appropriate items. 

11.Once you are finished mapping, click Import. This will automatically save the layout. 

 

